BT
/F1 14 Tf 18 TL 40 750 Td (CHINH SACH TRA HANG VA HOAN TIEN SHOPEE VIETNAM) '
/F2 9 Tf 12 TL (Target Customer Role: buyer) '
(Document Identifier: chinh-sach-tra-hang-hoan-tien) '
(Effective Date: 2026-01-01 | Version: 2.4 | Status: Active) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (1. OVERVIEW AND SCOPE OF RETURN AND REFUND POLICY) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Chinh sach Tra hang va Hoan tien nay quy dinh cac dieu kien, quy trinh va thu tuc) '
(danh cho Nguoi mua khi thuc hien yeu cau tra hang hoac hoan tien cho cac don hang mua) '
(sam tren san thuong mai dien tu Shopee Vietnam. Shopee cam ket bao ve quyen loi hop phap) '
(cua Nguoi mua va dam bao giao dich an toan, minh bach. Tat ca cac giao dich tren Shopee) '
(deu duoc bao ve boi chinh sach Shopee Guarantee. So tien thanh toan cua Nguoi mua se duoc) '
(Shopee giu an toan va chi chuyen cho Nguoi ban sau khi Nguoi mua xac nhan da nhan hang.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (2. ELIGIBILITY CONDITIONS FOR RETURN AND REFUND) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Nguoi mua co the yeu cau Tra hang va Hoan tien trong cac truong hop sau:) '
(a) Nguoi mua da thanh toan nhung khong nhan duoc san pham hoac san pham bi that lac.) '
(b) San pham bi loi, bi dam hai, mop meo hoac vo nhat trong qua trinh van chuyen. Nguoi mua) '
(can cung cap video mo hop va hinh anh ro rang lam bang chung.) '
(c) Shopee hoac Nguoi ban giao sai san pham cho Nguoi mua, bao gom sai kich thuoc, sai mau sac.) '
(d) San pham Nguoi mua nhan duoc khac bien ro ret so voi thong tin mo ta tren gian hang.) '
(e) San pham la hang gia, hang nhai hoac vi pham quyen so huu tri tue.) '
(f) Nguoi ban va Nguoi mua da tu thoa thuan va dong y cho phap tra hang.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (3. TIMEFRAME FOR SUBMITTING RETURN REQUESTS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Thoi gian Nguoi mua co the gui yeu cau Tra hang va Hoan tien duoc quy dinh nhu sau:) '
(- Doi voi don hang thong thuong (Shopee Standard): Trong vong 07 ngay ke tu ngay don hang) '
(duoc cap nhat trang thai Giao hang thanh cong.) '
(- Doi voi don hang Shopee Mall: Trong vong 15 ngay ke tu ngay don hang duoc cap nhat trang thai) '
(Giao hang thanh cong.) '
(- Sau khi het thoi han tren, Shopee Guarantee se het hieu luc. So tien thanh toan se duoc) '
(tu dong chuyen cho Nguoi ban va Shopee se khong the ho tro quyet dinh khieu nai tra hang.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (4. STEP-BY-STEP RETURN PROCESS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Quy trinh thuc hien tra hang duoc tien hanh qua 4 buoc chinh:) '
(Buoc 1: Gui yeu cau tren ung dung Shopee. Nguoi mua vao muc Don hang cua toi -> Chon don hang.) '
(Buoc 2: Xem xet va phan hoi tu Nguoi ban. Nguoi ban co 48 gio de dong y hoac khieu nai.) '
(Buoc 3: Dong goi va gui hang tra qua buu cuc voi ma van don tra hang mien phi.) '
(Buoc 4: Kiem tra va Hoan tien. Sau khi kho Shopee hoac Nguoi ban nhan duoc hang va kiem tra.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (5. RETURN SHIPPING FEES AND COVERAGE) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Shopee ho tro mien phi 100% chi phi van chuyen tra hang neu Nguoi mua su dung dung ma) '
(van don tra hang duoc tao truc tiep tren ung dung Shopee. Trong truong hop Nguoi mua tu) '
(gui hang qua cac don vi van chuyen ngoai ma khong dung ma cua Shopee, Nguoi mua se phai tu) '
(chi tra phi van chuyen ban dau. Shopee se xem xet hoan lai chi phi van chuyen duoi dang Xu.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (6. NON-RETURNABLE PRODUCTS AND EXCEPTIONS) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Cac danh muc san pham va truong hop khong ap dung chinh sach tra hang hoan tien:) '
(- Cac san pham ky thuat so, voucher dien tu, e-voucher, nap tien dien thoai, the game.) '
(- San pham thuoc danh muc thuc pham tuoi song, do an nhanh, hang hoa co han su dung ngan.) '
(- San pham do lot, do tap, my pham da mo seal hoac da qua su dung vi ly do an toan ve sinh.) '
(- San pham bi hu hong, bien dang, mat tem nhan do loi co y hoac khong la tu phia Nguoi mua.) '
T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL (7. REFUND METHODS AND PROCESSING TIMELINE) '
/F2 9.5 Tf 13 TL (Thoi gian Nguoi mua nhan duoc tien hoan phu thuoc vao phuong thuc thanh toan ban dau:) '
(- Vi ShopeePay: Hoan tien trong vong 24 gio lam viec sau khi yeu cau duoc phiet duyet.) '
(- Tai khoan Ngan hang lien ket / Chuyen khoan: Hoan tien trong vong 24-48 gio lam viec.) '
(- The Tin dung / The Ghi no: Hoan tien trong vong 07 den 14 ngay lam viec tuy theo ngan hang.) '
(- Thanh toan COD: Hoan tien vao Vi ShopeePay hoac Tai khoan Ngan hang da dang ky tren Shopee.) '
ET
